<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTPs) with a 6.00 percent coupon, and a third tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of 6.25 percent May 15, 2002 BTPs.</p>
<p>		  May 15, 2000   pvs	May 15, 2002   pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.37 pct    5.78	  5.51 pct    6.04</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.16 pct    6.57	  6.37 pct    6.90</p>
<p> Assigned price 99.80	 98.75	 99.90	 97.75</p>
<p> Bids	     4.139 trln lire	   4.665 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.000 trln lire	   2.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with a previous auction on May 30.</p>
</text>
